msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Unfortunately, 1.13.5.Final introduced a regression in the Hibernate "
"Validator extension due to a Jandex issue\n"
"(Jandex is our library indexing the classes and annotations)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Thus, we released 1.13.6.Final today to mitigate the issue."
msgstr ""

msgid "1.13.6.Final is a safe upgrade for everyone using Quarkus 1.13."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Please also check out https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-1-13-5-final-released/"
"[the 1.13.5 announcement]"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are not using 1.13 already, please refer to the https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-1.13[1.13 migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/1.13.6."
"Final[the full changelog of 1.13.6.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

